{"type":"message","message":{"id":"gen-1775345090-knZ8kEb52Yq4Gg9B9mom","role":"assistant","created":1775345094,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me search the JSON file for the TIPS data and see how it's structured. The page 53 data had TIPS offerings. Let me look at the JSON for the specific sections with TIPS data and also look for any price/adjusted data.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_df4accbb01f7499fa51c1e7d","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('/app/resources/treasury_bulletin_2007_12.json', 'r') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n    \n# Find all elements containing TIPS\nfor i, el in enumerate(data['document']['elements']):\n    if el.get('content') and 'TIPS' in str(el.get('content')):\n        print(f'Element {i}: {el.get(\\\"content\\\")[:500]}')\n        print('---')\n\""}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
{"type":"message","message":{"id":"msg_6f982ed9-d920-4b3e-a643-f28a96565784","role":"user","created":1775345094,"content":[{"type":"toolResponse","id":"call_df4accbb01f7499fa51c1e7d","toolResult":{"status":"success","value":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Element 455: Auction of 10-Year Treasury Inflation-Protected Security (TIPS)\n---\nElement 456: On July 9, 2007, Treasury announced it would auction $8,000 million of 10-year TIPS to raise new cash.\n---\nElement 457: The 10-year TIPS of Series D-2017 were dated July 15 and issued July 16. They are due July 15, 2017, with interest payable on January 15 and July 15 until maturity. Treasury set an interest rate of 2-5/8 percent after determining which tenders were accepted on a yield auction basis.\n---\nElement 458: Treasury received tenders for the TIPS before 12:00 noon e.d.s.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.d.s.t. for competitive tenders on July 12. Tenders totaled $15,735 million; Treasury accepted $8,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were allotted securities at the high yield of 2.749 percent with an equivalent adjusted price of $98.942199. Treasury accepted in full all competitive tenders at yields lower than 2.749. Tenders at the high yield were al\n---\nElement 459: Auction of 19-Year 6-Month 2-3/8 Percent TIPS\n---\nElement 460: On July 19, 2007, Treasury announced it would auction $6,000 million of 19-year 6-month 2-3/8 percent TIPS to raise new cash.\n---\nElement 461: The 19-year 6-month TIPS of January 2027 were dated July 15 and issued July 31. They are due January 15, 2027, with interest payable on January 15 and July 15 until maturity.\n---\nElement 462: Treasury received tenders for the TIPS before 12:00 noon e.d.s.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.d.s.t. for competitive tenders on July 24. Tenders totaled $13,373 million; Treasury accepted $6,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were\n---\nElement 464: In addition to the $6,000 million of tenders accepted in the auction process, Treasury accepted $1,294 million from FRBs for their own accounts. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of TIPS of January 2027 is $1,000.\n---\nElement 529: <table><tr><th>Auction date</th><th>Issue date (1)</th><th>Description of securities 1 (2)</th><th>Period to final maturity (years, months, days) 2 (3)</th><th>Amount tendered (4)</th><th>Amount accepted 3,4 (5)</th><th>Accepted yield and equivalent price for notes and bonds (6)</th></tr><tr><td>10/12/06</td><td>10/16/06</td><td>2-1/2% TIPS—07/15/16-D</td><td>9y 9m</td><td>18,122</td><td>9,412</td><td>2.426 - 101.503690</td></tr><tr><td>10/23/06</td><td>10/31/06</td><td>2-3/8% TIPS—04/15/11-G</t\n---","annotations":{"priority":0.0}}],"structuredContent":{"stdout":"Element 455: Auction of 10-Year Treasury Inflation-Protected Security (TIPS)\n---\nElement 456: On July 9, 2007, Treasury announced it would auction $8,000 million of 10-year TIPS to raise new cash.\n---\nElement 457: The 10-year TIPS of Series D-2017 were dated July 15 and issued July 16. They are due July 15, 2017, with interest payable on January 15 and July 15 until maturity. Treasury set an interest rate of 2-5/8 percent after determining which tenders were accepted on a yield auction basis.\n---\nElement 458: Treasury received tenders for the TIPS before 12:00 noon e.d.s.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.d.s.t. for competitive tenders on July 12. Tenders totaled $15,735 million; Treasury accepted $8,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were allotted securities at the high yield of 2.749 percent with an equivalent adjusted price of $98.942199. Treasury accepted in full all competitive tenders at yields lower than 2.749. Tenders at the high yield were al\n---\nElement 459: Auction of 19-Year 6-Month 2-3/8 Percent TIPS\n---\nElement 460: On July 19, 2007, Treasury announced it would auction $6,000 million of 19-year 6-month 2-3/8 percent TIPS to raise new cash.\n---\nElement 461: The 19-year 6-month TIPS of January 2027 were dated July 15 and issued July 31. They are due January 15, 2027, with interest payable on January 15 and July 15 until maturity.\n---\nElement 462: Treasury received tenders for the TIPS before 12:00 noon e.d.s.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.d.s.t. for competitive tenders on July 24. Tenders totaled $13,373 million; Treasury accepted $6,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were\n---\nElement 464: In addition to the $6,000 million of tenders accepted in the auction process, Treasury accepted $1,294 million from FRBs for their own accounts. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of TIPS of January 2027 is $1,000.\n---\nElement 529: <table><tr><th>Auction date</th><th>Issue date (1)</th><th>Description of securities 1 (2)</th><th>Period to final maturity (years, months, days) 2 (3)</th><th>Amount tendered (4)</th><th>Amount accepted 3,4 (5)</th><th>Accepted yield and equivalent price for notes and bonds (6)</th></tr><tr><td>10/12/06</td><td>10/16/06</td><td>2-1/2% TIPS—07/15/16-D</td><td>9y 9m</td><td>18,122</td><td>9,412</td><td>2.426 - 101.503690</td></tr><tr><td>10/23/06</td><td>10/31/06</td><td>2-3/8% TIPS—04/15/11-G</t\n---","stderr":"","exit_code":0},"isError":false}}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
